Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.14,0:06:17.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\c&H2A2FD7&\pos(1489.334,390.666)}那當然！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.14,0:06:17.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\c&HFA81FE&\pos(1814.667,536.001)}上啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.14,0:06:17.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\c&HE5B727&\pos(1369.714,853.714)}測量！
